#: main.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Kooka provides access to scanner hardware using the <a href=\"http://www."
"sane-project.org/\">SANE</a> library.\n"
"\n"
"Kooka allows you to scan, save and view in any image format that KDE "
"supports, and can perform Optical Character Recognition using the open "
"source <a href=\"http://jocr.sourceforge.net/\">GOCR</a> or <a href=\"http://"
"www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">OCRAD</a> programs, or the "
"commercial <a href=\"http://www.rerecognition.com/\">KADMOS</a> library."
msgstr ""
"Kooka pružatelji usluga pristupaju hardveru skenera koristeći <a href="
"\"http://www.sane-project.org/\">SANE</a> biblioteku.\n"
"\n"
"Kooka Vam omogućava skeniranje, snimanje i pregled bilo kojeg format slika "
"koji KDE podržava i može izvoditi Optičko prepoznavanje karaktera koristeći "
"otvoreni izvor <a href=\"http://jocr.sourceforge.net/\">GOCR</a> ili <a href="
"\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">OCRAD</a> programe ili "
"reklamu <a href=\"http://www.rerecognition.com/\">KADMOS</a> biblioteka."

