#: ocrocradengine.cpp:70
msgid ""
"<qt><p><b>OCRAD</b> is an free software OCR engine by Antonio&nbsp;Diaz, "
"part of the GNU&nbsp;Project. <p>Images for OCR should be scanned in black/"
"white (lineart) mode. Best results are achieved if the characters are at "
"least 20&nbsp;pixels high.  Problems may arise, as usual, with very bold or "
"very light or broken characters, or with merged character groups.<p>See <a "
"href=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">www.gnu.org/software/"
"ocrad/ocrad.html</a> for more information on OCRAD."
msgstr ""
"<qt><p><b>OCRAD</b> je besplatan softver OCR motora od strane Antonio&nbsp;"
"Diaz, dio GNU&nbsp;Project. <p>Slike za OCR trebaju biti skenirane u crno-"
"bijelom(iscrtavajućem) modu. Najbolji rezultati su postignuti ako su znakovi "
"barem 20&nbsp;piksela kvalitetni.  Problemi uobičajemo mogu nastupiti sa "
"znakovima koji su veoma debela ili veoma svijetla ili uništenim znakovima "
"ili sa spojenom grupom unakova.<p>Pogledajte <a href=\"http://www.gnu.org/"
"software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html</a> za "
"više informacija o OCRAD."

#: ocrocradengine.cpp:206
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Running the OCRAD process (<filename>%1</filename>) %2 with exit status "
"%3.<br>More information may be available in its <A HREF=\"%4\">standard "
"output</A> or <A HREF=\"%5\">standard error</A> log files."
msgstr ""
"<qt>OCRAD proces radi (<filename>%1</filename>) %2 sa izlaznim statusom %3."
"<br>Više informacija može biti dostupno na<A HREF=\"%4\">standardnom izlazu</"
"A> ili <A HREF=\"%5\">standardnoj grešci</A> log files."

